# "seclo" is the Mirandese word for "century", attested in native running
# text on the Mirandese Wikipedia (Biquipédia), e.g. the article title
# "Seclo XX" (mwl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seclo_XX). Plural "seclos" follows the
# regular -o -> -os pattern already used across this locale's other
# unit_*.voc files.
seclo
seclos
